{"id":"653034","name":"竹笋拌鸡丝","author":"可意妈妈","authorId":"2180856","desc":"","cover":"images/653034/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡胸肉","amount":"200g"},{"name":"笋","amount":"200g"},{"name":"香葱","amount":"半根"},{"name":"姜","amount":"2-3片"}],"sub":[{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"材料备齐。没有鲜笋，就用了袋装的笋丝。","img":"images/653034/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡肉切丝，葱切碎。","img":"images/653034/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"笋丝焯水备用。","img":"images/653034/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡肉加姜片，料酒，焯熟。","img":"images/653034/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鸡肉和笋丝放入盆中，加入生抽，米醋，葱花，香油拌匀。","img":"images/653034/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"装盘后表面撒少许白芝麻装饰一下即可。","img":"images/653034/step_6.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}